ner Birdy is not familiar with.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/1h65557eDg9nsUy6uSj6ZlwNUU6.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 2","synopsis":"Birdy meets up with her childhood friend, Nataru, and they talk for a bit. They are interrupted by a girl in a wheelchair, who treats Birdy coldly. A second of the criminals is tracked down, and she pursues him for a bit, but he escapes only to be killed in a violent manner Birdy is not familiar with.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/1h65557eDg9nsUy6uSj6ZlwNUU6.jpg","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"en-US"}}},{"title":"Episodio 3","episodeNumber":3,"sourceEpisodeNumber":3,"seasonNumber":2,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"6120","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[3]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"5074","episodeNumbers":[3]},{"provider":"mal","id":"5074","episodeNumbers":[3]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"37264","scope":"s2","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumbers":[3]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"82884","scope":"s2","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumbers":[3]}],"link":"65392","synopsis":"Senkawa and the journalism club go investigate a refugee camp. While Hayasumi is just trying to get a good story, Birdy is hoping to get a lead on another alien living in the camp. Two young children, Takumi and Marina, give the club a tour of the camp. They run away into the ruins so that they don't have to be separated, but get attacked by a group of thugs. Nataru, volunteering at the camp, goes after the children, but isn't strong enough on his own. Birdy arrives to rescue him.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/vraADA4f5MPGkqZUvIjiwFzfo7x.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 3","synopsis":"Senkawa and the journalism club go investigate a refugee camp. While Hayasumi is just trying to get a good story, Birdy is hoping to get a lead on another alien living in the camp. Two young children, Takumi and Marina, give the club a tour of the camp. They run away into the ruins so that they don't have to be separated, but get attacked by a group of thugs. Nataru, volunteering at the camp, goes after the children, but isn't strong enough on his own. Birdy arrives to rescue him.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/vraADA4f5MPGkqZUvIjiwFzfo7x.jpg","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"en-US"}}},{"title":"Episodio 4","episodeNumber":4,"sourceEpisodeNumber":4,"seasonNumber":2,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"6120","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[4]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"5074","episodeNumbers":[4]},{"provider":"mal","id":"5074","episodeNumbers":[4]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"37264","scope":"s2","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumbers":[4]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"82884","scope":"s2","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumbers":[4]}],"link":"65393","synopsis":"Birdy tracks down the illegal Virtual Reactor Chips purchaser, who is Nataru's father, Mr. Dusk. Dusk reveals he is a member of an Alterian freedom group, and that he helped disguise the escapees. Birdy goes after the nearest, but the escapees kidnap Dusk and interrogate him on the attacks on their number. He is murdered, which angers Nataru and upsets Birdy. Nataru kills another of the escapees, but not before learning Valic killed his father. Birdy promises to catch Dusk's killer.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/4HpY1CamRIPIqPKYk8q97dMHZM6.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 4","synopsis":"Birdy tracks down the illegal Virtual Reactor Chips purchaser, who is Nataru's father, Mr. Dusk. Dusk reveals he is a member of an Alterian freedom group, and that he helped disguise the escapees. Birdy goes after the nearest, but the escapees kidnap Dusk and interrogate him on the attacks on their number. He is murdered, which angers Nataru and upsets Birdy. Nataru kills another of the escapees, but not before learning Valic killed his father. Birdy promises to catch Dusk's killer.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/4HpY1CamRIPIqPKYk8q97dMHZM6.jpg","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"en-US"}}},{"title":"Episodio 5","episodeNumber":5,"sourceEpisodeNumber":5,"seasonNumber":2,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"6120","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[5]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"5074","episodeNumbers":[5]},{"provider":"mal","id":"5074","episodeNumbers":[5]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"37264","scope":"s2","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumbers":[5]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"82884","scope":"s2","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumbers":[5]}],"link":"65394","synopsis":"Iruma, Birdy's contact on Earth for information, is kidnapped by the escapees to lure her into a trap. She escapes being nearly killed by a long-range gun and fights to a draw. She collapses before she enters the portal to her ship, however. Tsutomu has a weird dream, a blend between his own memories and Birdy's. This is when he discovers he is trapped in Birdy's body. He is thus forced to follow her schedule, including a signing some of his classmates attend, a photo shoot and a reality contest where he has to eat bugs. At the end, he learns that personality merging has begun.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/bGAXPqGiD6vAEMNfniXFK1OsP0U.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 5","synopsis":"Iruma, Birdy's contact on Earth for information, is kidnapped by the escapees to lure her into a trap. She escapes being nearly killed by a long-range gun and fights to a draw. She collapses before she enters the portal to her ship, however. Tsutomu has a weird dream, a blend between his own memories and Birdy's. This is when he discovers he is trapped in Birdy's body. He is thus forced to follow her schedule, including a signing some of his classmates attend, a photo shoot and a reality contest where he has to eat bugs. At the end, he learns that personality merging has begun.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/bGAXPqGiD6vAEMNfniXFK1OsP0U.jpg","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"en-US"}}},{"title":"Episodio 6","episodeNumber":6,"sourceEpisodeNumber":6,"seasonNumber":2,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"6120","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[6]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"5074","episodeNumbers":[6]},{"provider":"mal","id":"5074","episodeNumbers":[6]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"37264","scope":"s2","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumbers":[6]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"82884","scope":"s2","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumbers":[6]}],"link":"65395","synopsis":"In an attempt to reverse the personality merging process, Tsutomu delves into Birdy's past. In this episode, he learns what it means to be an Iksiola, and how Birdy met Nataru.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/7yg5GXN6rrSnXDmu2tXQTgNJuWd.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 6","synopsis":"In an attempt to reverse the personality merging process, Tsutomu delves into Birdy's past. In this episode, he learns what it means to be an Iksiola, and how Birdy met Nataru.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/7yg5GXN6rrSnXDmu2tXQTgNJuWd.jpg","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"en-US"}}},{"title":"Episodio 7","episodeNumber":7,"sourceEpisodeNumber":7,"seasonNumber":2,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"6120","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"5074","episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"mal","id":"5074","episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"37264","scope":"s2","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"82884","scope":"s2","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumbers":[7]}],"link":"65396","synopsis":"Continuing the memory dive, Tsutomu learns more of the Central Tower attack and Birdy's part within it.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/3mfYc2fi3b6NjqSn1AzoQsDorj7.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 7","synopsis":"Continuing the memory dive, Tsutomu learns more of the Central Tower attack and Birdy's part within it.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/3mfYc2fi3b6NjqSn1AzoQsDorj7.jpg","t